{"license":"CC-BY-4.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bedrijfstelling 1963 - Tabel 1: Vestigingen. Werkzame personen. Vestigingen naar het aantal daarin werkzame personen. (Indeling op bedrijfsklasse)"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:47874"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"BDT1963"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"BDT 1963"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek (CBS)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"V.L.  Gilissen (DANS)"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Tabel 1: Vestigingen. Werkzame personen. Vestigingen naar het aantal daarin werkzame personen.<\/p><p>De bestanden zijn onderverdeeld op Bedrijfsklasse, Bedrijfsgroep en Bedrijfssubgroep.<br>In de map BEDRIJFSTAK_ALGEMEEN staan algemene bestanden op het niveau van de bedrijfstak.<\/p><p>Zie ook Tabel 6: Vestigingen. Werkzame personen. Vestigingen naar het aantal daarin werkzame personen. (Geografische indeling)<br>Verwijzingen naar de dataset met de bestanden van Tabel 6 en de datasets van de andere tabellen behorende bij de Bedrijfstelling 1963 kunt u vinden onder het kopje 'Relations' hieronder.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2011-11-30"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"historical demography"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"demographic data"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"population statistics"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-01-01"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-11-30"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-11-30"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>In 1999, to celebrate the jubilee of 100 years of the Statistics Netherlands, the publications with the results of all Dutch censuses of 1795, 1830, 1840, 1849, 1859, 1869, 1879, 1889, 1899, 1909, 1919, 1920, 1930, 1947, 1956, 1960 and 1971 have been scanned. In addition, the census data of the jubilee year 1899 have been entered in a database.<br><br>The data served for a creation of two sets of CD's published by the Statistics Netherlands:<br><br>Set 1: Data en publicatie volkstelling 1899. Two cd-rom's. ISBN 90.6861.176.3 (see http:\/\/www.aksant.nl\/boeken\/boek_464.asp).<br><br>Set 2: Publicaties volkstellingen 1795-1971. Five cd-rom's, ISBN 90.6861.177.1 (see http:\/\/www.aksant.nl\/boeken\/boek_465.asp).<\/p>"}}]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Data Archiving and Networked Services (DANS)","Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek (CBS)"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D64000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D42200"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Moderne en contemporaine geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"Modern and contemporary history"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D64000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Demografie"},{"lang":"en","value":"Demography"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D42200","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Social and public administration"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Bestuurskunde"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/5b22912f-5c83-42ae-bcf0-fa92e27ecae0"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/5b22912f-5c83-42ae-bcf0-fa92e27ecae0","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"}]},{"typeName":"dansRelation","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dansRelationType":{"typeNam